content.text:
Here is a concise report based on the repo at `/home/admin`.

---

## 1. Student management page

**學生管理** is implemented in **`/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/StudentsList.vue`** (not `StudentManagement.vue`). It is mounted from `App.vue` when the director selects the students tab (`active === 'students'`).

---

## 2. The “尚未設定補習科目/堂數” wording in code

The codebase does **not** use that full sentence in one string. The table header is **「補習科目 / 堂數」** and the empty state in that cell is only **「尚未設定」**:

```155:175:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/StudentsList.vue
            <td>
              <div class="subject-tags" v-if="getStudentCourses(student.id).length > 0">
                <span
                  v-for="course in getStudentCourses(student.id)"
                  :key="course.id"
                  :class="['subject-pill', { low: isSessionPaymentLowRemaining(course) }]"
                >
                  {{ getSubjectLabel(course.subject).split('(')[0].trim() }}
                  <template v-if="String(course.payment_type || '').toLowerCase() === 'monthly'">
                    <template v-if="parseCourseNumber(course.monthly_sessions) != null && parseCourseNumber(course.monthly_sessions) > 0">
                      每月<strong>{{ parseCourseNumber(course.monthly_sessions) }}</strong>堂
                    </template>
                    <template v-else>月結</template>
                  </template>
                  <template v-else>
                    <strong>{{ course.remaining_sessions ?? 0 }}</strong>堂
                  </template>
                </span>
              </div>
              <span class="hint" v-else>尚未設定</span>
            </td>
```

So the UI shows **「尚未設定」** when **`getStudentCourses(student.id).length === 0`**.

---

## 3. Logic: what drives `getStudentCourses` and when the hint appears

**Definition and filtering** (`getStudentCourses` + “historical” hiding):

```833:890:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/StudentsList.vue
const isHistoricalCourse = (course) => {
  const remaining = getCourseRemainingSessions(course);
  if (remaining == null) return false;
  return remaining <= 0 && isCourseSettled(course);
};
// ...
const getStudentAllCourses = (id) => studentCourses.value[id] || [];
const getStudentCourses = (id) => {
  const all = getStudentAllCourses(id);
  if (showHistoricalCourses.value) return all;
  return all.filter((course) => !isHistoricalCourse(course));
};
```

**Data fields involved**

| Purpose | Fields |
|--------|--------|
| “Historical” (hidden when toggle is off) | `remaining_sessions` / `RemainingSessions` (via `getCourseRemainingSessions`), plus **`isCourseSettled`**, which uses `payment_status`, `Paid`/`Charge`/`Pay`, etc. (`813`–`821`) |
| Pills content | `subject`, `payment_type`, `monthly_sessions`, `remaining_sessions` |

**`isCourseSettled`** (affects whether a 0-remaining course counts as “historical”):

```813:821:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/StudentsList.vue
const isCourseSettled = (course) => {
  const paymentStatus = String(course?.payment_status || '').toLowerCase();
  if (paymentStatus === 'paid') return true;
  const paid = parseCourseNumber(course?.Paid ?? course?.paid);
  const charge = parseCourseNumber(course?.Charge ?? course?.charge ?? course?.Pay ?? course?.pay);
  if (paid != null && charge != null) return paid >= charge && charge > 0;
  if (paid != null) return paid > 0;
  return false;
};
```

So **「尚未設定」** shows when, after filtering, there are **no** courses left—either because **`studentCourses[student.id]` is empty**, or because **every** course is treated as **`isHistoricalCourse`** (remaining ≤ 0 **and** settled), while **「顯示已結業/歷史課程」** is **off** (`showHistoricalCourses` is `false` by default: line `621`).

**Important product implication:** For **月結** courses, if **`remaining_sessions` is `0`** (numeric) and the course is considered **settled/paid**, those rows are **omitted** from the summary column even though the course may still be active—so the row can show **「尚未設定」** despite having real courses. **`isSessionPaymentLowRemaining`** explicitly skips monthly for the red “low” styling (`806`–`811`), but **`isHistoricalCourse` does not** skip monthly.

---

## 4. How course data is loaded and keyed

**Bulk load (fills the table pills)** — `loadAllStudentCourses`:

```1193:1244:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/StudentsList.vue
const loadAllStudentCourses = async () => {
  if (!props.branchId) {
    studentCourses.value = {};
    return;
  }
  try {
    const { data: { session: sess } } = await supabase.auth.getSession();
    const token = sess?.access_token;
    if (token) {
      const apiUrl = `/api/v1/student-classes?branch_id=${props.branchId}`;
      const { data: allData } = await fetchAllPages(apiUrl, token, { perPage: 200 });
      if (allData.length > 0) {
        const arr = allData;
        const map = {};
        arr.forEach((c) => {
          const sid = Number(c?.student_id ?? c?.StudentID ?? 0);
          if (!Number.isFinite(sid) || sid <= 0) return;
          if (!map[sid]) map[sid] = [];
          map[sid].push({
            id: c.id,
            student_id: sid,
            // ... fields ...
          });
        });
        studentCourses.value = map;
        return;
      }
    }
  } catch (_) {}
  // Supabase fallback ...
};
```

**Per-row load on expand** — `loadStudentCourses` uses **`GET /api/v1/student-classes?student_id=${laravelId}`** and stores under **`[studentId]`** (the Vue `student.id` passed in), with Laravel id from `_laravelId` when loading (`1131`–`1174`).

**Lookup key:** Pills use **`getStudentCourses(student.id)`**. When the list comes from **`GET /api/v1/students`**, `StudentController::transformStudent` sets **`id` and `_laravelId` to the same Laravel student id** (`35`–`47` in `StudentController.php`), so keys align with **`student_id`** on classes.

If the app **falls back to Supabase** for students (`1043`–`1079` in `StudentsList.vue`), **`student.id` can be a Supabase primary key** while **`studentCourses` is keyed by Laravel `student_id`** from the API map—then **`studentCourses[student.id]` can be empty** and the UI shows **「尚未設定」** even when Laravel has courses (until expand uses `_laravelId` and repopulates—actually `loadStudentCourses` keys by `student.id` from find, still the Supabase id). Worth noting as an **ID mismatch** risk on the fallback path.

---

## 5. Backend APIs for students and classes

| Use | Endpoint |
|-----|----------|
| Student list (學生管理) | **`GET /api/v1/students`** with `branch_id`, `per_page`, optional `name`, `status`, `class_id` (`1006`–`1027` in `StudentsList.vue`) |
| All courses for branch (pills) | **`GET /api/v1/student-classes?branch_id={branchId}`** (paginated via `fetchAllPages`) |
| One student’s courses (expand) | **`GET /api/v1/student-classes?student_id={laravelId}&per_page=100`** |
| Other related | e.g. **`POST /api/v1/student-classes/{id}/pause`**, etc. (`routes/api.php` ~287+) |

**`StudentClassController::index`** (`/home/admin/backend/app/Http/Controllers/StudentClassController.php`) applies:

- **Non–super-admin:** `whereHas('student', CampusID in `auth_campus_ids`)` (`42`–`46`).
- **`branch_id`:** courses match if **room’s campus** equals `branch_id`, **or** `room_id` is null **and** the **student’s `CampusID`** equals `branch_id` (`54`–`68`). Courses tied to a **room on another campus** may be **excluded** from that branch’s list even if the student “belongs” to the branch by `CampusID`.
- **`student_id`:** `where('StudentID', …)` (`72`–`74`).
- **`status`:** `active` / `inactive` vs `Stop` (`107`–`116`).
- **`teacher` role:** `applyTeacherOrSubstituteStudentClassScope` (different visibility) (`34`–`40`).

Directors using 學生管理 typically use **director** role + **`branch_id`**; teacher-specific scoping should not apply unless the same UI is reused under a teacher session.

---

## Summary table for your questions

| Item | Answer |
|------|--------|
| **Display condition (line refs)** | **`StudentsList.vue` `156`–`174`:** show pills if `getStudentCourses(student.id).length > 0`; else **`174`** `尚未設定`. Core logic **`886`–`890`** + **`833`–`837`**. |
| **Fields for “set up”** | Presence of **non-filtered** courses in `studentCourses[id]`; filtering uses **`remaining_sessions`**, **`payment_status` / Paid / Charge**, and **`showHistoricalCourses`**. |
| **APIs** | **`GET /api/v1/students`**, **`GET /api/v1/student-classes?branch_id=…`**, **`GET /api/v1/student-classes?student_id=…`**. |
| **Filtering that can hide valid courses** | **Branch/room/campus** rule; **`auth_campus_ids`**; **teacher scope**; frontend **`isHistoricalCourse`** (especially **monthly + `remaining_sessions === 0` + paid**); possible **Supabase vs Laravel `student.id` mismatch** on fallback. |

I did not find the exact string **「尚未設定補習科目/堂數」** in the repo; the implemented text is the column **「補習科目 / 堂數」** plus cell **「尚未設定」**.

